["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/ExternalIdentifierType/vatNumber", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment", "Value Added Tax (VAT) number, or Goods and Services Tax (GST) number, is an identifier assigned by tax authorities that uniquely identifies a business within a specific national border or tax jurisdiction for the collection and tracking of VAT/GST.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
